<nav class="glass nav wrap"><a class="logo" href="#top"><i>M</i> MOMENTUM</a><div><a href="#programs">Programs</a><a href="#method">Method</a><a href="#results">Results</a></div><button @click="choose(programs[1])">Book a call</button></nav>
<section id="top" class="hero wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">COACHING FOR REAL LIFE</p><h1>Build strength.<br><span>Keep momentum.</span></h1><p class="lead">Personal coaching, practical plans, and progress you can actually feel - without turning your life upside down.</p><div class="actions"><button class="primary" @click="choose(programs[1])">Find your program <b>↗</b></button><a href="#method">See how it works</a></div><div class="trust"><div class="faces">●●●●</div><p><b>4.9/5</b><br><span>from sample member feedback</span></p></div></div><div class="hero-visual glass"><div class="rings"></div><div class="athlete">MOVE<br><span>WITH</span><br>PURPOSE</div><div class="metric top"><small>WEEKLY CONSISTENCY</small><b>84%</b><span>↗ 12%</span></div><div class="metric bottom"><small>NEXT SESSION</small><b>Strength · 5:30</b></div></div></section>
<section id="programs" class="section wrap"><div class="heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CHOOSE YOUR PACE</p><h2>A plan that meets you here.</h2></div><p>Start small, build steadily, and adjust with support. Every program prioritizes consistency over extremes.</p></div><div class="programs"><article v-for="(p,i) in programs" :key="p.id" class="program glass" :class="p.accent"><div class="program-top"><span>0{{i+1}}</span><small>{{p.level}}</small></div><h3>{{p.name}}</h3><p>{{p.summary}}</p><ul><li>{{p.weeks}}-week roadmap</li><li>Weekly check-ins</li><li>Progress dashboard</li></ul><div class="price"><span>from</span><b>${{p.price}}</b></div><button @click="choose(p)">Choose {{p.name}} ↗</button></article></div></section>
