<section id="results" class="quote wrap section glass"><p>“The plan finally fit around my life. I stopped restarting every Monday and started building something I could keep.”</p><div><span class="avatar">MJ</span><span><b>Maya J.</b><small>8-week Momentum concept member</small></span></div></section>
